# cc-manager session definitions
#
# Format: title | directory | account [| claude_flags [| project_window]]
#
# title          — Tab title (convention: prefix with account initial, e.g. W: P: C:)
# directory      — Working directory (~ is expanded)
# account        — Account name as defined in accounts.conf
#                   (see config/accounts.example or ~/.config/cc-manager/accounts.conf)
# claude_flags   — (optional) Per-session Claude flags, overriding defaults.conf.
#                   Use "-" to disable global defaults for this session.
# project_window — (optional) Per-session layout override for the project window.
#                   Values: (empty) = inherit global, "-" = disable, stack, vsplit, hsplit, split
#                   The 4th column must be present (even if empty) when specifying the 5th.
#
# Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
# Whitespace around the pipe delimiters is trimmed.
# --- END OF DOCUMENTATION (do not edit above this line) ---

W:project-alpha  | ~/projects/project-alpha   | work
W:project-beta   | ~/projects/project-beta    | work
W:scratch         | ~/tmp                      | work

P:side-project   | ~/personal/side-project    | personal
P:dotfiles        | ~/dotfiles                 | personal

# If you define additional accounts in accounts.conf, reference them here:
# C:client-app    | ~/clients/client-x/app     | client-x
#
# Per-session flag overrides (optional 4th column):
# W:risky-project | ~/projects/risky           | work     | --dangerously-skip-permissions
# P:safe-project  | ~/personal/safe            | personal | -
#
# Per-session project_window overrides (optional 5th column):
# W:with-split    | ~/projects/beta            | work     |                               | vsplit
# W:no-window     | ~/projects/gamma           | work     | -                             | -
